00:03:14.486 --> 00:03:17.197
Poked some holes in its back

00:03:14.486 --> 00:03:17.197
so it can breathe.

00:03:17.239 --> 00:03:19.117
See, look at this...

00:03:17.239 --> 00:03:19.117
Oh, boy.

00:03:19.951 --> 00:03:21.619
All right, hang on,

00:03:19.951 --> 00:03:21.619
hang on.

00:03:44.809 --> 00:03:47.770
I also feel like this show

00:03:44.809 --> 00:03:47.770
is unique in that...

00:03:47.812 --> 00:03:51.690
Because it's animated we can

00:03:47.812 --> 00:03:51.690
push boundaries a little bit

00:03:47.812 --> 00:03:51.690
further

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:55.486
Some of the things that

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:55.486
our characters say,

00:03:55.527 --> 00:03:56.445
