00:04:01.784 --> 00:04:04.536
As a matter of fact, Joe,

00:04:01.784 --> 00:04:04.536
yes, I think it's immoral.

00:04:04.578 --> 00:04:07.456
It's a lifestyle choice

00:04:04.578 --> 00:04:07.456
