Yeah, I got a few minutes.

00:04:39.238 --> 00:04:41.615
My wife's getting an abortion.

00:04:41.657 --> 00:04:43.325
The "Partial Terms

00:04:41.657 --> 00:04:43.325
of Endearment" episode,

00:04:43.367 --> 00:04:45.661
<i>the thing to me that's most</i>

