00:04:53.502 --> 00:04:54.879
<i>All in the Family</i> episode.

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:57.589
It's a women's

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:57.589
responsibility

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:57.589
