00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:16.877
of<i> Star Wars.</i>

00:06:16.919 --> 00:06:22.466
We had done a number of

00:06:16.919 --> 00:06:22.466
<i>Star Wars</i> gags on the show and,

00:06:22.507 --> 00:06:26.095
They were so frequent

